</solution></exercise>
<section><exercise id="_909d6029-1695-4a0b-94eb-e5abf4758dd3" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2-10x\)?</para>
        </problem><solution><para>Correct! 5</para><para>The correct answer is 5.</para></solution></exercise></section><list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated">
