<section><exercise id="_4d51c3c1-2de5-4dcf-af08-be98d21c5303" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=-x^2+50x\)?</para>
        </problem><solution><para>Correct! 25</para><para>The correct answer is 25.</para></solution></exercise></section><list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated">
